# ============================================================================
# Optional. Copy to /opt/solutionmines/edge.env ONLY when this box runs more
# than one site behind a single shared proxy.
#
# With no such file, deploy.sh drives the nginx install that bootstrap.sh
# performs, which is the right setup for a server dedicated to this site.
#
# Five values, because that is what differs between edges: where the upstream
# is written, what a line in it looks like, how the edge is validated, how it
# is reloaded, and the URL that proves traffic really arrives through it.
# ============================================================================

# --- Defaults: nginx on this box, as installed by bootstrap.sh --------------
# UPSTREAM_FILE=/etc/nginx/conf.d/solutionmines-upstream.conf
# UPSTREAM_LINE='server 127.0.0.1:__PORT__;'
# EDGE_TEST_CMD='nginx -t'
# EDGE_RELOAD_CMD='nginx -s reload'
# SMOKE_URL=http://127.0.0.1/api/health

# --- Example: a shared Caddy, itself running in a container -----------------
# The proxy reaches the containers by NAME over a shared docker network, so
# the switch rewrites a container name rather than a port. __COLOUR__ is
# replaced with blue or green; __PORT__ with 3001 or 3002.
#
# UPSTREAM_FILE=/opt/edge/sites/solutionmines-upstream.caddy
# UPSTREAM_LINE='reverse_proxy solutionmines-__COLOUR__:3000'
# EDGE_TEST_CMD='docker exec edge-caddy-1 caddy validate --config /etc/caddy/Caddyfile'
# EDGE_RELOAD_CMD='docker exec edge-caddy-1 caddy reload --config /etc/caddy/Caddyfile'
# SMOKE_URL=http://127.0.0.1/api/health
